# FC27 pipeline: raw API pages and run state are large, regenerable and
# machine-specific. The normalized CSV/JSON deliverables under data/fc27/
# ARE committed — they are the point of the pipeline.
data/fc27/raw/
data/fc27/last-run.json
# The JSON mirrors are the same records as the committed CSVs — the male one
# alone is 26 MB, 2.5x the largest data file the repo already carries. The CSVs
# are the deliverable; regenerate the JSON with `npm run fc27:normalize` (or a
# full `npm run fc27:build`) when a consumer needs it.
data/fc27/*.json
!data/fc27/discovery.json
# The reconciliation report is the evidence behind the club/league coverage
# claims, and small enough to review in a diff.
!data/fc27/reconciliation.json
